    "_uid": "1937-root",
    "title": "The Open Islamicate Texts Initiative Arabic-script OCR Catalyst Project (OpenITI AOCP)",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "CorpusBuilder, OpenITI's digitization platform, will now be transformed into a full digital text production pipeline, thanks to a new grant from the Mellon Foundation",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "1d971943276c5771",
