      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKU-ISMC is delighted to announce that the Open Islamicate Texts Initiative, of which Professor Sarah Bowen Savant is a co-Principal Investigator, has received a grant of $800,000 from Mellon Foundation for the development of a digital text production pipeline for Persian and Arabic that will incorporate a wide range of new OCR enhancements. This grant will help to expand the number and range of Arabic and Persian texts that are in machine-readable format, and so greatly aid in research using digital methods. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
